<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41206" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισχερώ</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχερός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in a row, one after another,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσανέβαινον ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.68
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				11.668
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.125
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀλλήλοισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.528
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γὰρ ἦμιν ἐ. ἦεν ἀοιδῆς</span>”
				<i>the next thing in..,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.451
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of Time,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρὶς ἐ.</span> thrice
				<i>successively,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				155.5
			</span></i>; <i>by degrees,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				14.69
			</span></i>.</div>
